  triage:title "Evidence provenance ambiguity clarified and residual schema gap identified" ;
  triage:description "Original finding (arch-ctm prod review, msg 01M1D6WRFXDMWFPJ3NHZ02V9ZF): artifacts carried host_label=rand-m5.local with no execution-account field, raising ambiguity about isolated-account execution (required by phase-av-plan.md:155-160). Counter-evidence (Cipher-311d, msg 01M1D70416RTEK14FJ2KJR4CMN): all four campaigns (20260831T210351Z, 20260831T210445Z, 20260831T210540Z, 20260831T212118Z) ran via ssh atmbench@rand-m5.local, whoami=atmbench, HOME=/Users/atmbench, all reports/logs owned atmbench:staff, account daemon stopped after, shared randlee daemon untouched — host_label is machine identity only. Correction (arch-ctm, msg 01M1D72GEGNP7HPH0ZZ9JQZKFE): original 'DO-NOT-SHIP' withdrawn, revised to 'SHIP-WITH-CONDITIONS'; finding narrows to residual (AV-PROD-001R): JSON/report schema has host_label but NO execution_account/uid/home provenance field, preventing artifacts alone from proving isolated-account execution for future audits. Disposition: account-level provenance confirmed for AV.4; residual schema gap requires post-merge fix to reporting/JSON schema per Rand's directive." ;
